{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/197466-what-s-in-your-go-bag","id":197466,"title":"What's in Your Go Bag?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-14T21:49:00-07:00","id":197466,"title":"What's in Your Go Bag?","content":"The Bug Out Bag and the Go Bag are staples of modern espionage. It represents the ability to instant prepare yourself to go into danger or to get out of if, the dramatic signal that this isn't the character's first rodeo, plus the narrative justification of having the precise tool at the right time all rolled into one; it's the modern adventurer's pack.<br /> <br /> Wikipedia has a start:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bugout_bag#Typical_contents\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Moscow_Polytechnical_Museum%2C_cosmonaut%27s_survival_kit.jpg/1280px-Moscow_Polytechnical_Museum%2C_cosmonaut%27s_survival_kit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bugout_bag#Typical_contents\" target=\"_blank\"> Survival kit - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bugout_bag#Typical_contents\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bugout_bag#Typical_contents </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The folks over at Pagan press have given this issue some thought:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.delta-green.com/2012/04/the-delta-green-toolkit-version-1-1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.delta-green.com/2012/04/the-delta-green-toolkit-version-1-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 &mdash; Page not found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.delta-green.com/2012/04/the-delta-green-toolkit-version-1-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.delta-green.com/2012/04/the-delta-green-toolkit-version-1-1/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Google fu turns up a few more options:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.shtfplan.com/emergency-preparedness/building-your-bugout-bag-the-complete-infographic-checklist_04302013\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.shtfplan.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/shtfplan-com-logo-white-no_tag.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.shtfplan.com/emergency-preparedness/building-your-bugout-bag-the-complete-infographic-checklist_04302013\" target=\"_blank\"> Page Not Found | SHTF Plan </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.shtfplan.com/emergency-preparedness/building-your-bugout-bag-the-complete-infographic-checklist_04302013\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.shtfplan.com/emergency-preparedness/building-your-bugout-bag-the-complete-infographic-checklist_04302013 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://graywolfsurvival.com/669/bug-out-bag-list-contents/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://graywolfsurvival.com/669/bug-out-bag-list-contents/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://graywolfsurvival.com/669/bug-out-bag-list-contents/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://graywolfsurvival.com/669/bug-out-bag-list-contents/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"http://bugoutbagacademy.com/free-bug-out-bag-list/\" target=\"_blank\">http://bugoutbagacademy.com/free-bug-out-bag-list/</a><br /> <br /> Now, many of these things will be redundant depending on form abilities, embed, exploits and gadgets, but sometimes mundane tools <i>can</i> win the day, and they attract much less attention.<br /> <br /> So... what's in your character's bag? When hunter Angels break down the front door, or the code text message saying the Ring is raiding the local Elimination Infrastructure tonight, what does your character grab from beneath the floor boards in the shed out back?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}